Z||000013||bHooper||02-08-2000||04:39 PM||||YES Ed does do excellent work!!<P>Congrats, BBBAD GT!  That is a a very clean looking car, from email photos at least!  I was chating with the owner about the car, he told me that someone was going to buy it.  I was interested, but the timeing wasn't right for me.  Again, congrats!!!!  ||||reg||1
